WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:02.869
FILLING IN FOR CHAD ARMSTRONG

00:00:02.936 --> 00:00:05.939
WHO IS OUT SICK TODAY.

00:00:06.005 --> 00:00:07.807
WE ARE HERE LIVE
AT THE METRO POLICE DEPARTMENT

00:00:07.874 --> 00:00:09.909
K-9 TRAINING FACILITY,

00:00:09.976 --> 00:00:12.412
AND WE ARE GOING TO BE LEARNING
SOME APPREHENSION TECHNIQUES

00:00:12.479 --> 00:00:14.681
USED BY THE K-9 UNIT.

00:00:14.748 --> 00:00:17.951
NOW, OFFICER HANSON, UH, I WILL
BE PLAYING THE ASSAILANT TODAY.

00:00:18.017 --> 00:00:19.152
IS THAT CORRECT?
- YEAH, THAT'S CORRECT.

00:00:19.219 --> 00:00:21.054
- NOW, OFFICER HANSON,

00:00:21.121 --> 00:00:22.355
I AM PERFECTLY SAFE
IN THIS SUIT RIGHT?

00:00:22.422 --> 00:00:24.524
- YEAH, YOU'RE 100% SAFE.

00:00:24.591 --> 00:00:26.426
IN FACT, THOSE ARE THE SUITS
WE USE FOR OFFICER TRAINING.

00:00:26.493 --> 00:00:28.528
- ALL RIGHT!
WELL, THERE YOU GO.

00:00:28.595 --> 00:00:29.763
WELL, KIDS, MAKE SURE
THAT YOU DO NOT TRY THIS AT HOME

00:00:29.829 --> 00:00:31.331
WITH YOUR CHIHUAHUAS.

00:00:31.398 --> 00:00:33.500
OW! OW! OW!
[bleep]!

00:00:33.566 --> 00:00:35.301
GET THIS [bleep] OFF OF ME!
GET THIS [bleep] OFF OF ME!

00:00:35.368 --> 00:00:37.036
DAMN!
GET THIS [bleep] OFF OF ME!

00:00:37.103 --> 00:00:38.738
[bleep]!

00:00:38.805 --> 00:00:41.007
OH, GOD DAMN!
OH, GOD DAMN!

00:00:41.074 --> 00:00:44.244
OH, [bleep]!
WHOO!

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:47.647
OKIE DOKEY.
I AM SORRY...

00:00:47.714 --> 00:00:51.017
THAT, UH, YOU ALL JUST HEARD ME
USE THAT INAPPROPRIATE LANGUAGE.

00:00:51.084 --> 00:00:52.852
THAT WAS VERY UNCALLED FOR.

00:00:52.919 --> 00:00:54.888
- WHEN YOU PANIC LIKE THAT...
- YEAH.

00:00:54.954 --> 00:00:55.922
- HE THINKS YOU'RE MORE
OF A THREAT THAN YOU ARE.

00:00:55.989 --> 00:00:57.857
- UH-HUH.

00:00:57.924 --> 00:00:59.926
- THAT'S WHEN HE'S GONNA
BITE DOWN HARDER.

00:00:59.993 --> 00:01:01.795
- OKAY, WELL, I WILL...
MAKE AN EFFORT THIS TIME TO...

00:01:01.861 --> 00:01:04.130
REALLY TRY AND BE
AS CALM AS POSSIBLE

00:01:04.197 --> 00:01:05.665
EVEN THOUGH IT IS
VERY DIFFICULT TO BE CALM

00:01:05.732 --> 00:01:07.700
WHEN YOU'RE IN THE LION'S DEN.

00:01:07.767 --> 00:01:08.935
OR SHOULD I SAY
THE DOGGIE DEN?

00:01:09.002 --> 00:01:10.570
YOU KNOW WHAT I MEAN?

00:01:10.637 --> 00:01:12.472
[screaming]
OH, [bleep]!

00:01:12.539 --> 00:01:14.641
OH, [bleep]!
THIS DOG IS EATING MY JUNK!

00:01:14.707 --> 00:01:16.376
HE'S EATING MY JUNK!
NO!

00:01:16.443 --> 00:01:18.578
OH, [bleep]!
HE'S GOT MY JUNK!

00:01:18.645 --> 00:01:20.246
AGHH! OH, MY GOD!
GET HIM OFF ME!

00:01:20.313 --> 00:01:21.314
[happy music]

